# =================== Personal data protection ===================
# JSON exports of the prompt manager contain the user's prompts and
# categories. They must never be committed or published.
prompt-manager-backup-*.json
prompt-manager-data.json
prompt-manager-data.json.bak
prompt-manager-data.json.tmp-*

# =================== OS / editor junk ===================
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# =================== Development ===================
node_modules/
coverage/
*.log

# =================== Local project docs ===================
# Of the documentation, only README.md and README_de.md are published.
# The changelog, plan and compaction notes stay in the local workspace
# and are never pushed.
CHANGELOG.md
PLANUNG.md
COMPACTIONS.md
